
## Main API Endpoints

All API routes are under `/api/` and accept JSON.

### Auth
- `POST /api/auth/register/`
- `POST /api/auth/login/`
- `POST /api/auth/refresh/`
- `GET /api/auth/me/` — JWT protected

### Wallet
- `GET /api/wallet/`
- `GET /api/wallet/transactions/`
- `POST /api/wallet/deposit/`
- `POST /api/wallet/withdraw/`

### Sports
- `GET /api/sports/`
- `GET /api/matches/`
- `GET /api/matches/{id}/`
- `PATCH /api/matches/{id}/update-odds/` — admin/master

### Bets
- `POST /api/bets/place/`
- `GET /api/bets/`

### Reports
- `GET /api/reports/overview/` — admin/master
- `GET /api/reports/daily/` — admin/master

### Audit
- `GET /api/admin/audit-logs/` — admin/master

### Payments (webhook for deposit confirmation)
- `POST /api/payments/webhook/`

## Public Web Routes

| Path | Purpose |
|------|---------|
| `/` | Home page showing next matches |
| `/register/` | Create account |
| `/login/` | Session login |
| `/logout/` | Session logout |
| `/matches/` | All matches list |
| `/matches/{id}/` | Match detail + bet placement form |
| `/wallet/` | View wallet, pending deposits, make deposit/withdraw |
| `/bets/` | View user bet history |

## Environment
Copy `backend/.env.example` to `backend/.env` for non‑Docker development.  
Docker Compose already passes suitable defaults.

